Instance: ShiftBHSHIFTBHNCD
InstanceOf: ShiftSlsValueSet
Usage: #definition
Title: "SHIFT BH NCD"
Description: """
Term is related to a neurocognitive disorder, including dementia, delirium, and amnesia.

Identified as: ShiftCustomActSensitivityCodes#BHNCD
