Usage: #definition
Title: "SHIFT CONTRACEPTION | SHIFT REPRO OTHER"
Description: """
SHIFT CONTRACEPTION: Contraception and family planning, including emergency contraception. Excludes abortion and medical abortifacients.; SHIFT REPRO OTHER: Other reproductive-health issues: gynecologic routine care/disease (e.g., endometriosis)/cancer (e.g., ovarian cancer); male reproductive-tract routine care (e.g., prostate cancer screening)/disease/cancer (e.g., epididymitis, testicular torsion, testicular cancer); menopause; low testosterone; menorrhagia; PCOS; etc.

